    "message": "Bind actual copy parity to exact South-word translation recurrences\n\nDerive all nine physical South copies and the marker copy from complete kernel parity, actual mask tests and bounded-carry resets. Preserve full cyclic coordinates, reflected collisions and the two vanishing bare-source residues; retain explicit count and fractional-phase inputs.\n\nProve generic binary-word splitting and its actual offset19/20 specializations through the aligned-cell equivalence. Bound the offset20 prefix error from two distinct physical selectors, without label or occupation premises. Record independent full-source review, four fresh bounded Lean replays and sixteen standard-only theorem-axiom reports. Correct the documented namespace of ConZFC; keep the decimal equation and metrics unchanged.",
